flowchart LR
    Start[Authentication Request] --> LoginB[Login Backend]
    LoginB -- Success --> Authenticated[User Authenticated]
    LoginB -- Fail --> EmailTokenB[Email Token Backend]
    EmailTokenB -- Success --> Authenticated
    EmailTokenB -- Fail --> OAuth2B[OAuth2 Backend]
    OAuth2B -- Success --> Authenticated
    OAuth2B -- Fail --> OIDCB[OIDC Backend]
    OIDCB -- Success --> Authenticated
    OIDCB -- Fail --> Failed[Authentication Failed]

    Authenticated --> Session[Set Session Cookie]
    Session --> User[Populate Request.user]